00:11:14.901 --> 00:11:18.501
-You're an evil, evil man.
You're a sick, evil man.

00:11:18.501 --> 00:11:20.300
And how are you not crying?

00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:21.868
Wait, you haven't eaten
your wings!

00:11:21.868 --> 00:11:24.067
Oh, my gosh.

00:11:24.067 --> 00:11:27.200
Last one.
I haven't even touched it yet.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:29.868
Oh, my gosh. Hey, hey.

00:11:29.868 --> 00:11:31.901
[ Speaking gibberish ]

00:11:31.901 --> 00:11:34.667
There's nothing in that.
[ Speaking gibberish ]

00:11:34.667 --> 00:11:36.667
-What are you doing?!
-Adam Sandler.

00:11:36.667 --> 00:11:38.234
-Thank you, say Adam Sandler.
Just say Adam Sandler.

00:11:38.234 --> 00:11:40.000
-It is Adam Sandler!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:42.601 --> 00:11:43.734
-I don't know if you know this.

00:11:43.734 --> 00:11:46.634
But you have something in common
with Billie.

00:11:46.634 --> 00:11:49.868
You're an inspiration
for the song "Bad Guy."

00:11:49.868 --> 00:11:51.834
But not you.

00:11:51.834 --> 00:11:53.501
-Am I the bad guy?
-You're not the bad -- no.

00:11:53.501 --> 00:11:55.400
-No, I'm kidding.
-The theme song of

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.968
"Wizards of Waverly Place"...
[ Cheers ]

00:11:57.968 --> 00:11:59.634
...was an inspiration --
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:59.634 --> 00:12:03.434
was an inspiration to her --
to getting the tune.

00:12:03.434 --> 00:12:05.200
-That's --
-Isn't that bizarre?

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.300
-I love you.
-So, I thought maybe

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:07.801
it'd be fun to play --
-I love Billie.

00:12:07.801 --> 00:12:09.667
-...to play a little bit
and see if we can see...

00:12:09.667 --> 00:12:11.434
-Oh, gosh. Okay.
-...what inspired her.

00:12:11.434 --> 00:12:15.701
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Okay.

00:12:15.701 --> 00:12:17.133
-Here's a little bit
of "Wizards."

00:12:17.133 --> 00:12:18.167
-Okay.
-Okay?

00:12:18.167 --> 00:12:19.434
-Oh, no.
-Yeah.

00:12:19.434 --> 00:12:20.434
[ Laughter ]

00:12:20.434 --> 00:12:21.868
♪♪

00:12:21.868 --> 00:12:23.567
-♪ Well, you know everything
is gonna be a breeze ♪

00:12:23.567 --> 00:12:25.501
♪ That the end will,
no doubt, justify the means ♪

00:12:25.501 --> 00:12:27.834
♪ You could fix any problem
with the slightest of ease ♪

00:12:27.834 --> 00:12:28.934
♪ Yes, please ♪

00:12:28.934 --> 00:12:31.300
-Oh, my God!
[ Laughter ]

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:32.968
-♪ Ba, ba-doo doo ♪

00:12:32.968 --> 00:12:34.334
-Yeah.
-That's kind of -- right?

00:12:34.334 --> 00:12:35.901
Here's "Bad Guy."

00:12:35.901 --> 00:12:37.667
[ "Bad Guy" plays ]

00:12:37.667 --> 00:12:39.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:12:39.534 --> 00:12:42.267
♪♪

00:12:42.267 --> 00:12:43.734
-That's so cool.
-Kinda, right?

00:12:43.734 --> 00:12:44.868
Isn't that cool?
-That's so cool.

00:12:44.868 --> 00:12:45.968
-That's pretty fun.
I think that's cool.

